This crate builds JohnnyGuitar NVSE (JohnnyGuitarNVSE.dll), the NVSE plugin, into nv-rs, with its
authors' permission (the maintainer, 2026-11-03: every mod author gave it). Source read:
JohnnyGuitar NVSE at git c87905e (internal/JG/EditorIDRestoration.cpp and JohnnyExtraData).
Its changes are rebuilt here from that source and the game's own code; no C++ is included.

